      "result": "All 13 checklist items have been tested and recorded — **10 PASS, 3 FAIL**.\n\n## Summary of failures\n\n**FT-2 — Hotspot overlay actions unreachable**\nThe overlay renders correct data, but `.overlay-content` has Tailwind centering classes (`-translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2`) that are overridden by an inline `transform: scale(...)` from the entry animation. The panel is therefore anchored *at* the viewport centre rather than centred on it (rect x=639, y=360, h=577 in a 1280×720 viewport). Both the 查看详情 link and 继续探索 button land at y≈864, below the fold, and `overflow:hidden` prevents scrolling to them — Playwright clicks fail with \"element is outside of the viewport.\"\n\n**IX-12 — No 360° wrap-around; hotspots permanently lost**\nYaw is an unbounded `translateX` with no modulo. Sweeping 24 drags one way (105px → 1185px) and 60 the other (1185px → −1515px) never wrapped back. Hotspots only exist in a narrow band (roughly +105px to −120px); at all other positions zero hotspots are in the DOM. Zoom itself behaves correctly (scale 1 → 1.4, hotspots return on zoom out) — the failure is the missing wrap.\n\n**IX-10 — Category-browsing link doesn't leave the detail page**\nThe header \"分类浏览\" nav item and all four footer category links use `href=\"#categories\"` instead of `/#categories`. From a detail page this only appends the hash to the current URL, leaving the user on the detail page. The breadcrumb \"非遗项目\" and the \"浏览更多项目\" button work correctly.\n\n## Notable positives\nCamera/zoom state restoration (FT-5) is exact, list filter/sort state survives detail-page round trips (IX-14), the gallery's explicit `图片加载失败` failure state works, hotspot loading shows progressive `正在加载热点... (n/8)` feedback, and the invalid-slug route shows a clean not-found state.\n\nOne testing note: hotspots animate continuously (consistent with the \"must not pause\" requirement), which makes Playwright's element-stability gate reject clicks on them; I dispatched those clicks directly to proceed.",
